
!.env.example
!.vscode/extensions.json
# (decision D6, ssot/09-runbooks/secrets-rotation.md).
# ---- Data / dumps ------------------------------------------------------------
# ---- Node / pnpm -------------------------------------------------------------
# ---- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------------
# ---- Personal / never commit -------------------------------------------------
# ---- Prisma ------------------------------------------------------------------
# ---- Python (EDMC plugin) ----------------------------------------------------
# ---- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# ---- Vendored upstream -------------------------------------------------------
# Cloned and pinned at build time, not committed (ssot/05-integrations/coriolis.md).
# Galaxy dumps are multi-GB. Never commit one.
# Generated client only. Migrations ARE committed.
# Production secrets live in a root-owned 0600 .env ON THE SERVER, never here
# Your own working notes. Safe to put IDs, keys and half-finished thoughts in.
